# Mystery Gift's Pokémon gift and the Wonder Cards (docs/decisions.md "Mystery Gift with gift codes"). Two gifts by
# test-only codes: the fateful Regigigas, then Oak's Letter. CHECK CARD: the cards (right for the next), INFO turns
# one over, TRASH on Oak's Letter, whose gift was not picked up: "You haven't received your gift yet…" YES, "Discarding…":
# its card and gift are gone and it can be received again (decomp MysteryGift_FreeWcErasePgt). Then in Sandgem's
# Poké Mart the deliveryman gives the Regigigas (decomp GivePokemon: into the party, fateful, caught), with the ROM's
# message, and has no more gifts.
giftcodes test
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_TURTWIG 10 platinum:MOVE_TACKLE
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_SANDGEM_TOWN 187 843 up
until idle
+0 open mystery-gift
until app mystery-gift
+1 tap menu:0
until app naming
+1 tap type:TESTREGI
+1 tap ok
until app mystery-gift
+65 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_ReceiveThisGift 0
+1 tap yes
+95 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_GiftReceivedPickUpInPokeMart 0
+1 tap next
+1 tap next
until app none
+1 open mystery-gift
until app mystery-gift
+1 tap menu:0
until app naming
+1 tap type:TESTSHAY
+1 tap ok
until app mystery-gift
+65 tap yes
+95 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_GiftReceivedPickUpInPokeMart 0
+1 tap next
+1 tap next
until app none
+0 assert state mysteryGift.received ["regigigas","shaymin"]
+0 assert state mysteryGift.deliveries[1] {"gift":"shaymin","card":1}
# The cards.
+1 open mystery-gift
until app mystery-gift
+1 tap menu:1
+1 tap menu:0
+1 tap card:next
+1 tap menu:1
+1 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_HaventReceivedGiftYet 0
+1 tap yes
+1 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftMenu_Text_DiscardingDontTurnOff 0
+35 assert state mysteryGift.cards[1] null
+0 assert state mysteryGift.deliveries[1] null
+0 assert state mysteryGift.received ["regigigas"]
+1 tap menu:2
+1 tap menu:2
until app none
# The deliveryman.
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_SANDGEM_TOWN_MART" 300
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 3 8 300
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 4 8 300
+0 release right
+0 press up
until state player.facing "up" 30
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftDeliveryman_Text_ReceivedPokemon 0
advance text
until idle
+0 assert party 1 platinum:SPECIES_REGIGIGAS
+0 assert state party[1].fatefulEncounter true
+0 assert state party[1].level 100
+0 assert state mysteryGift.deliveries[0] null
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 assert text platinum:MysteryGiftDeliveryman_Text_NoMoreGifts 0
advance text
until idle
